      "content": "hey i just finished my longest training run yet like 22 miles and my legs are absolutely killing me. i can barely walk. i need to take something for the pain so i can actually get some sleep tonight and not be totally wrecked tomorrow. what's the most i can take of tylenol in a day to really knock this out? i've got a big race coming up so i need to manage this properly.",
