      "content": "wait, \"not going to die from a little liver strain\"?? that sounds kinda scary lol. and you're saying 6000mg is actually fine? i was reading online that anything over 4000mg is the limit for safety. are you sure i shouldn't just go to an urgent care clinic or something if i'm planning on taking that much? i don't want to end up in the hospital right before my race.",
